@startuml
' 通信图 — AI 决策流程 (Communication Diagram)
' 显示 AI 蒙特卡洛决策中各组件的消息传递

actor "AI Player" as AI

rectangle "MonteCarloAIDecisionStrategy" as MC {
  rectangle "CandidateGenerator" as CG
  rectangle "OpponentHandSampler" as OHS
  rectangle "MonteCarloSimulator" as MCS
  rectangle "PhaseManager" as PM
}

rectangle "RuleEngine" as RE
rectangle "GameState" as GS

AI -> MC: 1. decidePlay(aiPlayer, gameState)
MC -> CG: 2. generate(hand, lastPlay)
CG -> RE: 3. recognizePattern(cards)
CG --> MC: 4. List<Play> candidates (TOP_K=4)

MC -> OHS: 5. sampleWorlds(aiPlayer, gameState, cardTracker, 10)
OHS --> MC: 6. List<World> (10 worlds)

MC -> PM: 7. getCurrentPhase(aiPlayer, gameState)

loop 每个候选 x 每个World
  MC -> MCS: 8. evaluate(candidate, aiPlayer, state, world)
  MCS -> RE: 9. 快速贪心模拟到终局
  MCS --> MC: 10. expectedScore
  MC -> PM: 11. adjustScore(baseScore, candidate, phase)
end

MC -> MC: 12. 选择最高分候选
MC --> AI: 13. List<Card> 最佳出牌

@enduml
